    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Purple is sustaining a genuine operational recovery, with showroom comparable sales positive for a third straight quarter and e-commerce trends improving sequentially. The rollout of the premium Purple Royale line at Mattress Firm is generating early traction, signaling renewed wholesale momentum and a push into higher-end segments. While the broader mattress and home-furnishings backdrop remains mixed, Purple’s brand is showing resilience at retail touchpoints and online, suggesting stabilization and rebuilding demand.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership is maintaining the guiding narrative of gradual improvement, reaffirming full-year EBITDA targets and signaling better sequential performance ahead. The emphasis on premium product placement through key wholesale accounts and the steady execution of showroom growth point to a deliberate, credibility-rebuilding strategy. The tone from the Q1 release is cautiously confident, though the limited input available provides only a thin snapshot of progress without independent verification from analyst commentary or deeper market context.",
